  {
   "id": "concept2",
   "type": "concept",
   "title": {
    "en": "The motivation process"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Unsatisfied need → tension → drives → search behaviour → satisfied need → reduction of tension. An unmet need creates tension, the tension creates drives, and the person searches for a way to satisfy the need.",
    "kn": "ಪೂರೈಸದ ಅಗತ್ಯ → ಒತ್ತಡ → ಪ್ರಚೋದನೆ → ಹುಡುಕಾಟ ವರ್ತನೆ → ಅಗತ್ಯ ಪೂರೈಕೆ → ಒತ್ತಡ ಕಡಿಮೆ."
   },
   "points": [
    {
     "en": "Unsatisfied need"
    },
    {
     "en": "Tension"
    },
    {
     "en": "Drives"
    },
    {
     "en": "Search behaviour"
    },
    {
     "en": "Satisfied need"
    },
    {
     "en": "Reduction of tension"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "Unsatisfied need → tension → drives → search behaviour → satisfied need → reduction of tension. An unmet need creates tension, the tension creates drives, and the person searches for a way to satisfy the need.",
    "kn": "ಪೂರೈಸದ ಅಗತ್ಯ → ಒತ್ತಡ → ಪ್ರಚೋದನೆ → ಹುಡುಕಾಟ ವರ್ತನೆ → ಅಗತ್ಯ ಪೂರೈಕೆ → ಒತ್ತಡ ಕಡಿಮೆ."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "concept3",
   "type": "concept",
   "title": {
    "en": "Maslow's need hierarchy"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Abraham Maslow arranged needs in five levels: basic physiological needs, safety or security needs, affiliation or belonging needs, esteem needs and self-actualisation needs. A satisfied need no longer motivates; a person moves to the next level only when the lower need is reasonably satisfied.",
    "kn": "ಮ್ಯಾಸ್ಲೋ ಅಗತ್ಯಗಳನ್ನು ಐದು ಹಂತಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ಜೋಡಿಸಿದರು: ಮೂಲ ದೈಹಿಕ, ಸುರಕ್ಷತೆ, ಸೇರ್ಪಡೆ, ಗೌರವ ಮತ್ತು ಸ್ವ-ಸಾಕ್ಷಾತ್ಕಾರ. ಪೂರೈಸಿದ ಅಗತ್ಯ ಪ್ರೇರಣೆ ನೀಡುವುದಿಲ್ಲ."
   },
   "points": [
    {
     "en": "Physiological: food, shelter, basic salary"
    },
    {
     "en": "Safety: job security, pension"
    },
    {
     "en": "Affiliation: friendship, acceptance"
    },
    {
     "en": "Esteem: status, recognition"
    },
    {
     "en": "Self-actualisation: becoming what one is capable of"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "Abraham Maslow arranged needs in five levels: basic physiological needs, safety or security needs, affiliation or belonging needs, esteem needs and self-actualisation needs. A satisfied need no longer motivates; a person moves to the next level only when the lower need is reasonably satisfied.",
    "kn": "ಮ್ಯಾಸ್ಲೋ ಅಗತ್ಯಗಳನ್ನು ಐದು ಹಂತಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ಜೋಡಿಸಿದರು: ಮೂಲ ದೈಹಿಕ, ಸುರಕ್ಷತೆ, ಸೇರ್ಪಡೆ, ಗೌರವ ಮತ್ತು ಸ್ವ-ಸಾಕ್ಷಾತ್ಕಾರ. ಪೂರೈಸಿದ ಅಗತ್ಯ ಪ್ರೇರಣೆ ನೀಡುವುದಿಲ್ಲ."
   }
