   "id": "ex1",
   "type": "example",
   "problem": {
    "en": "Ravi earns a good salary and has a permanent job. He now wants his colleagues to respect him and his work to be recognised. Which need is he trying to satisfy, and which levels are already met?"
   },
   "steps": [
    {
     "en": "Good salary covers basic physiological needs; permanent job covers safety needs."
    },
    {
     "en": "Respect and recognition are esteem needs."
    },
    {
     "en": "By Maslow, he has also met affiliation needs before seeking esteem."
    }
   ],
   "answer": {
